desc(
	mode: "struct"
	language: "java"
	title: "Struct scan: Java GroovyShell.evaluate"
	title_zh: "结构扫描：Java GroovyShell.evaluate"
	type: vuln
	level: high
	rule_id: "struct-java-groovyshell-evaluate"
	risk: "groovy-code-execution"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
检测到 GroovyShell.evaluate。外部脚本可导致任意代码执行。

### 风险类型
groovy-code-execution

### 影响
该用法属于已知危险 API 或弱密码学原语，若处理外部数据或用于安全场景，可能导致命令执行、代码执行、反序列化或机密性破坏。

### 检测方式
结构扫描在编译单元内匹配真实调用，而不是注释或字符串字面量。
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
禁止对不可信输入调用 GroovyShell.evaluate。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://Dyn.java": <<<POS
class Dyn {
  Object bad(String code) {
    groovy.lang.GroovyShell shell = new groovy.lang.GroovyShell();
    return shell.evaluate(code);
  }
}
POS
	"safefile://DynSafe.java": <<<NEG
class DynSafe {
  int ok() {
    return 2;
  }
}
NEG
)

GroovyShell as $call
GroovyShell() as $call
GroovyShell.evaluate(* as $code) as $call
*.evaluate(* as $code) as $call
alert $call for {
	level: "high",
	title: "GroovyShell.evaluate Call",
	title_zh: "GroovyShell.evaluate 调用",
	message: "结构扫描：Java GroovyShell.evaluate",
	risk: "groovy-code-execution",
}
